.KEY ALLDIR/A,MACHINE/A
.BRA [
.KET ]
; Release check of one target from the payload in RAM:vc without OpenGL or an upgrade: smoke,
; then install, use and remove with apkg (copied to RAM:ctest).
; Execute RAM:vc/run-release <results directory> <machine name>. Its key is not RUNDIR: the
; scripts it runs set their own RUNDIR, which would replace it here.
FailAt 21
MakeDir [ALLDIR]/smoke [ALLDIR]/pkg
Execute RAM:vc/run-smoke [ALLDIR]/smoke
MakeDir RAM:ctest
Copy RAM:vc/apkg RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/vc.zip RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/idx.json RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/steps-pkg.json RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/steps-pkg2.json RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/shapes.svg RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/run-use RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Copy RAM:vc/run-pkg RAM:ctest/ QUIET
Execute RAM:ctest/run-pkg [ALLDIR]/pkg [MACHINE]
Echo "all done" >[ALLDIR]/all-done.txt
